title: Laya-Android
type: software
version: 0.2.1
date-released: 2026-10-07
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Byun11/laya-android
abstract: >-
  Laya-Android is a 322M non-generative decision model specialized for Android GUI
  action selection from accessibility-based interaction trajectories. It fine-tunes
  the Laya typed-decision model (Convai Innovations) on AndroidControl.
